        <mxCell id="package_rules" value="&lt;b&gt;Updated package rule&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;common/ is frozen and supplies shared types/interfaces. emergencies imports only common/ (Responder, ColonyContext, OperationResult, Location, EmergencyType). It has no dependency on agents, facilities, resources, missions, or colony. Other allowed one-way dependencies include agents/facilities/environment/resources → missions and colony; colony coordinates the packages; Main depends on colony. Emergency subclasses store String ids instead of typed refs; malformed ids fail at runtime rather than compile time. No dependency cycles." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8dc;strokeColor=#c9a227;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
